2. Cough relief: Mullein has expectorant properties, which help to loosen and remove mucus from the respiratory tract, making it effective in relieving coughs.

3. Bronchital spasm relief: Mullanin, a compound found in Mullan, has been shown to have bronchodilator effects, which can help to relax and open up the airways, making it useful in treating bronchitis and asthma symptoms.

