<start_of_turn>model
","The correct diagnosis is $\boxed{\text{Avasive ductal carcinoma (ADC) with central necrosis}}$. 

**Explanation:**
1. **Atypical cells in ducts** suggest a carcinoma (cancer) of the breast ducts.
