   \]
   \[
   \Delta S = 629.4 - 797.7
   \]
   \[
   \Delta S = -168.3 \, \text{J/mol K}
   \]

The entropy change for the reaction is \(\boxed{-168.3 \, \text{J/mol K}}\).
