   \]

2. **Integrate term by term:**
   \[
   \int_{-1}^{2} (x^2 + 2) \, dx = \int_{-1}^{2} x^2 \, dx + \int_{-1}^{2} 2 \, dx
   \]
   \[
   = \left[ \frac{x^3}{3} \right]_{-1}^{2} + \left[ 2x \right]_{-1}^{2}
   \]

