   \[
   = \left( \frac{2^3}{3} - \frac{(-1)^3}{3} \right) + \left( 2 \cdot 2 - 2 \cdot (-1) \right)
   \]
   \[
   = \left( \frac{8}{3} + \frac{1}{3} \right) + (4 + 2)
   \]
   \[
   = \frac{9}{3} + 6
   \]
   \[
   = 3 + 6 = 9
   \]

Thus, the value of the definite integral is \(\boxed{9}\).
