"Find an exponential function of the form \(f(x) = a b^x\) that passes through the points \((-2, 6)\) and \((2, 1)\).","<bos><start_of_turn>user
Find an exponential function of the form \(f(x) = a b^x\) that passes through the points \((-2, 6)\) and \((2, 1)\).<end_of_turn>
