Let  $ABC$   be a triangle and let  $X$  be on  $BC$  such that  $AX=AB$ . let  $AX$  meet circumcircle  $\omega$  of triangle  $ABC$  again at  $D$ . prove that circumcentre of triangle  $BDX$  lies on  $\omega$ .<end_of_turn>
