   The percentage change in the rate of heat transfer is:  
   \[
   \text{Percentage change} = \left( \frac{2 \times 104.5}{104.5} - 1 \right) \times 100 = 100\%
   \]  

   **Final Answer:**  
   The rate of heat transfer from the plate to the air is \(\boxed{104.5 \, \text{kW}}\).  
