1. **Calculate the uncertainty in energy (\(\Delta E\))**:
   \[
   \Delta E \geq \frac{\hbar}{2 \Delta t} = \frac{1.054 \times 10^{-34} \text{ J s}}{2 \times 10^{-23} \text{ s}} = 5.27 \times 10^{-12} \text{ J}
   \]
   Convert this to MeV:
   \[
   \Delta E = 5.27 \times 10^{-12} \text{ J} \times \frac{1 \text{ MeV}}{1.602 \times 10^{-13} \text{ J}} \approx 32.9 \text{ MeV}
   \]

