   \]
   Substituting the given values:
   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{gas}} = 1.005 \ln \left( \frac{550 + 273.15}{1100 + 273.15} \right) = 1.005 \ln \left( \frac{823.15}{1373.15} \right)
   \]

